      "Single ingredient, with no sweetener or flavor",
      "About 26 g of protein per two-scoop serving per the brand",
      "Budget-tier cost per gram in the large bag"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Milky, slightly chalky taste that needs other flavors in the recipe",
      "Absorbs a lot of liquid, so recipes need adjusting",
      "Not a sport certification; NSF Contents Certified per the brand"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The casein to buy if you want to build the flavor yourself.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "About 26 g per 2 scoops (brand)",
      "Calories": "About 120 (check label)",
      "Third-party tested": "NSF Contents Certified (brand)",
      "Best for": "Savory and from-scratch bakes"
