      "One ingredient, with no sweetener or flavor",
      "About 25 g of protein in roughly 120 calories per the label",
      "Budget-tier cost per gram"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Pure whey dries out fast if you replace too much flour",
      "Contains some lactose, as all concentrates do",
      "No sport certification confirmed"
